s to track down the survivors. Sense their fear, follow their traces, and ensure that no one escapes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Set Traps to Jump Scare Survivors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550130/extras/930f7685e48382df1d1d70bd9be720fb.poster.avif?t=1750962453\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550130/extras/930f7685e48382df1d1d70bd9be720fb.webm?t=1750962453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550130/extras/930f7685e48382df1d1d70bd9be720fb.mp4?t=1750962453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Surprise is your deadliest weapon! Place sinister traps and evoke panic-filled screams. Keep the survivors guessing when the next terror will strike.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unlock New and Powerful Abilities or Passives</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550130/extras/b4be53aedf4b271bdec6997b46b199aa.poster.avif?t=1750962453\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550130/extras/b4be53aedf4b271bdec6997b46b199aa.webm?t=1750962453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With every victim, you grow stronger. Unlock new abilities and passive bonuses that sharpen your hunting instincts and transform you into an unstoppable force.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Destroy Obstacles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550130/extras/f4a56a22582ce67f7322161d4424115e.poster.avif